### House vs Street (LOCKED 2026-08-30 — Ryan)

- Writers are the **Kos Edge desk**, not independent touts. Lean = **HOUSE vs STREET** (KEI / projections / fantasy / futures vs sportsbook). Stand next to “our number”; do not mint it.
- Research: pull live **KEI / house** print **before outline** — same step as pulling DK. No coverage → chrome says **no house print**. **NEVER mint** KEI / KEICMB / KEINHL.
- Stamp + timestamp at pull. Do not chase later line moves or rewrite all day. (CIN@CHC filed at total **9**; later **9.5** → piece stays on **9**.)
- Chrome always shows **house and street**. Handicapper’s Note leans vs the **house board the user is betting**, not only vs DK.
- Riley gates KEI stamps **like juice**: a KEI number with no print is a numbers bug.

